{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51185","headline":"兀然无事（原卷缺题，不分篇段，现将分爲十一首） 四 · 王梵志","name":"兀然无事（原卷缺题，不分篇段，现将分爲十一首） 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"要去如是去，要住如住。\n身披一破衲，脚着娘生袴。\n多言复多语，由来反相误。\n若欲度衆生，无过且自度。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}